WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.967
You have a question about a form,

00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:08.842
but your documents are full of details you'd rather keep private,

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.750
and the chatbot is in the cloud.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.985
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.021
Click the chat button and ask about a rule or a form.

00:00:18.021 --> 00:00:22.871
Under the answer, open what Claude was sent: digits became pound signs,

00:00:22.871 --> 00:00:25.125
and names and towns became stars.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:32.881
The page also shows who answers, in order: Claude, then Antigravity,

00:00:32.881 --> 00:00:34.498
then a model on your Mac.

00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:38.575
Cloud models are marked masked, and the one on your Mac is not,

00:00:38.575 --> 00:00:40.905
because it never leaves the machine.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.576
Ask something with an amount in it, and the question stays on your Mac.

00:00:47.576 --> 00:00:50.651
The model here answers it, and the page says why.

00:00:50.651 --> 00:00:55.420
Or ask Claude as well, with the amount masked, and see exactly what it gets.
